{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chameleonjp-lab/shinariokanri/pulls/22","id":4798707602,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU8BEJ88AAAABHgZ3kg","html_url":"https://github.com/chameleonjp-lab/shinariokanri/pull/22","diff_url":"https://github.com/chameleonjp-lab/shinariokanri/pull/22.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/chameleonjp-lab/shinariokanri/pull/22.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chameleonjp-lab/shinariokanri/issues/22","number":22,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"RB10: 大容量の冷間読込を全件検査と取消を保って分割","user":{"login":"chameleonjp-lab","id":283055705,"node_id":"U_kgDOEN8WWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/283055705?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab","html_url":"https://github.com/chameleonjp-lab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Largeの起動で保存済み全行を一度に受け取るため、実際に入力可能になるまでの正式30回p95が10,306.8msとなり、10秒を超えました。同じreadonly transactionのまま全範囲を2048件ずつ読み、各batchの前後に取消を確認します。全件を取得してから作者の元順に戻し、scope・欠損・schema・Unicode・hash・parts・固定世界と旧版の検査を維持します。\n\n- 対応：REQ-N05/N06/N09/N18、AT-N05/N06/N09/N18の関連正常・失敗条件、RV27/29/30。原104要件・24工程・116ケース・6回帰群、元資料26件hash、DBv7・完全形式・各上限を保持。\n- 新しい境界検査：2049件の逆順、別作品の同じID、2048件後の取消→native8table不変→全件再開、末尾foreign entity/不正blockの拒否→元データ不変→修復後再読込。全764単体／81ファイル成功。\n- 通常画面：Chromium/Firefox/WebKitで関係表320px/200%・一覧再選択/保存/空new-clone/coldの6件、実保存失敗/任意診断・native parts取消/再試行/cold全本文の6件が成功。schema生成差分なし、文書・計画・Python15、production build成功。\n- 途中結果も保持：読む順序だけの試作は改善せず不採用。新しい機能検査の初回30秒watchdog超過はraw/sourceとともに残し、その検査だけ120秒と段階ログへ変更。元fixture・期待・性能／解析時間は不変。dirty3回の8,285/7,434/7,693msは診断だけで正式合格へ換算しません。\n- 固定候補：572c6df91d09e141555c2f752b246107a2512786 / tree1822ac96925fa765068a6339c5e828fe24f3e998 / clean build d20d298b7ea8ae89db82、base /shinariokanri/。source359・原文26・dist12・生成runtimeをSHAで結合。\n- 基底：PR21が外部で取り込まれたmain449de9b/tree457261（C8と同tree）。C8のCI37905586728全20step763/261、Standard各30回局所成功、Large正式30回未達をcandidate-8に分離保持します。C8成功やdirty検査をC9の最終受入へ流用しません。\n\n固定C9の実行結果（2026-10-09 10:38 UTC時点）：\n\n- CI run 37912747066は全20 step成功。764単体、Chromium/Firefox/WebKitのproduction通常画面261件、schema・文書・計画・Python15・buildを確認。実際のcheckout 69c9a6167df4353a6c6e4407d4b7844c3d6d5dbcのtreeはC9と同じ1822acです。\n- Standard 8,800件、各30回、8指標は局所基準内。p95はキャッシュから実際の入力可能1,605.8ms、操作選択17.3ms／切替49.4ms、検索94.1ms、原子保存568.0ms、期間変更14.5ms、稼働年表16.8ms／図16.734ms。500ms debounceを保存区間に混ぜていません。\n- Large 88,003件＋実素材bytes72MiB、各30回の初回入力p95 7,675.7ms／検索579.9ms。初回の遅い測定も削除せず、全件・hist/outbox・素材SHAを毎回確認。Linux自動ブラウザーの局所測定として記録し、実端末の性能合格へ換算しません。\n- Largeの読込取消・再開、通常一覧から再選択、2編集の原子保存、完全出力取消、完全ファイル→空390px新規／独立clone→再起動後再読込が成功。88,003件、固定版、履歴、復元された送信待ち、72MiBの素材bytesを検証。完全ファイルSHA 931ab276002e21ce258b6573817c6828d0acde8c7d9939ccd337097cefe4fadb。\n- 実時間7200秒のLarge継続編集を10:25:36 UTCに開始して継続中。13回の編集／試読時点でerrorなし。経過短縮せず、最後の完全出力→空環境冷間復元まで終わってから判定します。\n- 独立レビューは元116条項に照らして実施中。320px／200%／保存失敗・復元、章順変更・型付き条件・実PNG/WAV素材の通常操作は実観測済み。元の境界fixture・上限を保持した検査を順次実行し、部分観測は全ケース合格としません。\n- ローカルの9 SQL migration＋23権限契約検査とreview lifecycle、独立したEdge再生成hash一致を確認。実Auth/RLS/privateStorageの証拠には使いません。\n\nPR #22は外部で取り込まれ、最新main 4bd437153aa29e8ecc3024f139db9fea97a47474のtreeも1822acで一致します。根拠のtargetは上記固定C9です。2時間結果・元116ケースの最終独立照合と証拠台帳は後続のレビュー可能な成果にまとめます。\n\n実iPhone/iPad/PC各OS・IME/Files/録音・VoiceOver/NVDA、専用実Auth/RLS/privateStorage・5実アカウント・現行quota/費用は未実行です。release evidence gateと公開保留を維持します。\n\nマージ・本番公開・新規課金・外部DB変更は実行していません。\n","created_at":"2026-10-09T09:40:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T10:39:24Z","closed_at":"2026-10-09T10:30:23Z","merged_at":"2026-10-09T10:30:23Z","merge_commit_sha":"4bd437153aa29e8ecc3024f139db9fea97a47474","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chameleonjp-lab/shinariokanri/pulls/22/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chameleonjp-lab/shinariokanri/pulls/22/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chameleonjp-lab/shinariokanri/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chameleonjp-lab/shinariokanri/issues/22/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chameleonjp-lab/shinariokanri/statuses/572c6df91d09e141555c2f752b246107a2512786","head":{"label":"chameleonjp-lab:feat/rb10-bounded-cold-read","ref":"feat/rb10-bounded-cold-read","sha":"572c6df91d09e141555c2f752b246107a2512786","user":{"login":"chameleonjp-lab","id":283055705,"node_id":"U_kgDOEN8WWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/283055705?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab","html_url":"https://github.com/chameleonjp-lab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chameleonjp-lab/received_events","type":"User","use